post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'

THPM needs one user-level setup step after package installation:

  thpm install           # hook, templates, and graphical manager
  thpm install --no-ui   # hook and templates without the graphical manager

You can add the graphical manager later with:

  thpm ui install

Run these commands as your normal desktop user, not as root.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  cat <<'EOF'

If you use the THPM graphical manager, deploy the updated QML files with:

  thpm ui install

Run this command as your normal desktop user, not as root.
EOF
}
